The dedication above covers Chalkboard's own source code. It does not
and cannot cover third-party material distributed with this repository,
which remains under its own terms:

  - apps/web/src/vendor/excalifont/fonts/ — Excalifont outlines, SIL
    Open Font License 1.1, Copyright (c) 2024 Excalidraw. See OFL.txt and
    ATTRIBUTION.txt in that directory.
  - apps/web/src/vendor/excalifont/mathlive-*.{js,css} — MathLive,
    Copyright (c) 2017-present Arno Gourdol. See MATHLIVE_LICENSE.txt
    in that directory.
  - Installed dependencies, each under the license recorded in
    pnpm-lock.yaml and summarized by
    `node scripts/check-dependency-licenses.mjs`.

The License section of README.md is the authoritative record of these terms.
